1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,113
YEVA: Almost half of US counties have no cardiologist.

2
00:00:03,163 --> 00:00:07,462
YEVA: In rural areas, the nearest one is an 87-mile round trip.

3
00:00:07,512 --> 00:00:14,973
YEVA: So a nurse at a small clinic has to decide: which patient with chest pain really needs that trip?

4
00:00:15,023 --> 00:00:16,950
YEVA: That's what HeartPost helps with.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:25,531
YEVA: HeartPost uses only seven things a small clinic can measure, like age, type of chest pain and blood pressure.

6
00:00:25,581 --> 00:00:31,402
YEVA: This is a real patient our model never saw. Red zone: refer soon.

7
00:00:31,452 --> 00:00:34,111
YEVA: And it isn't a black box.

8
00:00:34,161 --> 00:00:39,982
YEVA: Every score is a short sum of points you can check by hand.

9
00:00:40,032 --> 00:00:44,950
YEVA: His real angiography result: heart disease. The model got it right.

10
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,223
IPATIY: This woman was sick too.

11
00:00:47,273 --> 00:00:51,768
IPATIY: With one threshold for everyone, she'd have been sent home.

12
00:00:51,818 --> 00:01:00,859
IPATIY: We found the model was missing half of sick women, so women get their own threshold, and now she's caught.

13
00:01:00,909 --> 00:01:03,132
IPATIY: But we don't hide mistakes.

14
00:01:03,182 --> 00:01:08,132
IPATIY: This woman also had heart disease, and the model said green.

15
00:01:08,182 --> 00:01:14,950
IPATIY: Young patients with unusual pain are its weak spot, and the app warns about it.

16
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:21,379
ARIANA: We trained on one US hospital and tested on three others the model never saw.

17
00:01:21,429 --> 00:01:23,950
ARIANA: Here are all 678 test patients.

18
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:29,521
ARIANA: Move the threshold: you catch more sick people, but get more false alarms.

19
00:01:29,571 --> 00:01:35,521
ARIANA: A textbook model with thirteen tests missed 93 sick patients in the new hospitals.

20
00:01:35,571 --> 00:01:39,379
ARIANA: The simplest baseline rule missed 83. Ours missed 43.

21
00:01:39,429 --> 00:01:44,950
ARIANA: Now switch off the women's threshold, and ten sick women turn red: missed.

22
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:54,656
YEVA: Our data is from the 1980s, so next we'd test on today's patients with real clinicians, and grow this home follow-up demo.

23
00:01:54,706 --> 00:01:59,950
YEVA: HeartPost: seven simple measurements, fair to women, and honest about its mistakes.
